    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you discover the truths hidden within the corpses before you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven people have met their end in a mansion under mysterious circumstances. James Milton, a distinguished detective and forensic expert, is called upon to solve his final case.<br>Only the solitary sound of rain accompanies his days spent among the dead and their haunting whispers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/cc9c3f0abb43740f39322737fea691b6.poster.avif?t=1743512841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/cc9c3f0abb43740f39322737fea691b6.webm?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/cc9c3f0abb43740f39322737fea691b6.mp4?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each secret they reveal brings him one step closer to a chilling truth. This time, however, ancient esoteric tools gifted by an enigmatic presence give a new dimension to his investigation, allowing the detective to delve into the lives and sins of the victims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/5dc3a17e47ce2149dc2371d682f09ccb.poster.avif?t=1743512841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/5dc3a17e47ce2149dc2371d682f09ccb.webm?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/5dc3a17e47ce2149dc2371d682f09ccb.mp4?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An entire laboratory at your disposal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your investigation will focus on performing autopsies on the unfortunate victims who, just hours ago, were inhabiting the Bolden's Mansion. Every tiny detail could be the key to uncovering the reason behind their untimely demise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every tool at your disposal to reveal even the smallest clue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique daguerreotype camera will allow you to examine the victims' fates more closely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine science and the esoterism in your alchemical lab to create photographic reagents that unveil shocking truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, rely on your trusty detective's board to connect each victim to their killer and bring this harrowing case to a close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/41daeccc64e5496474734107c089e539.poster.avif?t=1743512841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/41daeccc64e5496474734107c089e539.webm?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/41daeccc64e5496474734107c089e539.mp4?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you discover the truths hidden within the corpses before you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven people have met their end in a mansion under mysterious circumstances. James Milton, a distinguished detective and forensic expert, is called upon to solve his final case.<br>Only the solitary sound of rain accompanies his days spent among the dead and their haunting whispers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/cc9c3f0abb43740f39322737fea691b6.poster.avif?t=1743512841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/cc9c3f0abb43740f39322737fea691b6.webm?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/cc9c3f0abb43740f39322737fea691b6.mp4?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each secret they reveal brings him one step closer to a chilling truth. This time, however, ancient esoteric tools gifted by an enigmatic presence give a new dimension to his investigation, allowing the detective to delve into the lives and sins of the victims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/5dc3a17e47ce2149dc2371d682f09ccb.poster.avif?t=1743512841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/5dc3a17e47ce2149dc2371d682f09ccb.webm?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/5dc3a17e47ce2149dc2371d682f09ccb.mp4?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An entire laboratory at your disposal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your investigation will focus on performing autopsies on the unfortunate victims who, just hours ago, were inhabiting the Bolden's Mansion. Every tiny detail could be the key to uncovering the reason behind their untimely demise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every tool at your disposal to reveal even the smallest clue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique daguerreotype camera will allow you to examine the victims' fates more closely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine science and the esoterism in your alchemical lab to create photographic reagents that unveil shocking truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, rely on your trusty detective's board to connect each victim to their killer and bring this harrowing case to a close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/41daeccc64e5496474734107c089e539.poster.avif?t=1743512841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/41daeccc64e5496474734107c089e539.webm?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448870/extras/41daeccc64e5496474734107c089e539.mp4?t=1743512841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
